---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Self-Employed Health Insurance Deduction Calculator" description="Calculate your allowable tax deduction for health insurance premiums as a freelancer.">
  <main class="container">
    <h1>Self-Employed Health Insurance Deduction</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">See how much of your health premiums you can deduct.</p>
    <div class="calc-box">
      <div class="input-group"><label>Annual Net Profit ($)</label><input type="number" id="profit" placeholder="e.g. 60000" /></div>
      <div class="input-group"><label>Annual Health Premiums Paid ($)</label><input type="number" id="premiums" placeholder="e.g. 8000" /></div>
      <button id="calcBtn">Calculate Deduction</button>
      <div id="result" class="hidden result-box">
        <p class="total">Allowable Deduction: <strong id="deduction"></strong></p>
        <p class="sub">Note: <span>You cannot deduct more than your net profit.</span></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <article class="article-content">
      <h2>The Self-Employed Health Insurance Deduction</h2>
      <p>If you are self-employed, you can deduct the premiums you paid for medical, dental, and long-term care insurance for yourself, your spouse, and your dependents. However, the deduction is limited to your net self-employment profit.</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
<script>
  document.getElementById('calcBtn')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    const profit = parseFloat(document.getElementById('profit').value);
    const premiums = parseFloat(document.getElementById('premiums').value);
    if (isNaN(profit) || isNaN(premiums)) { alert("Fill all fields"); return; }

    const deduction = Math.min(profit, premiums);

    document.getElementById('deduction').innerText = "$" + deduction.toFixed(2);
    document.getElementById('result').classList.remove('hidden');
  });
</script>
<style>
  .container { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 16px; }
  h1 { text-align: center; } .subtitle { text-align: center; color: #6b7280; margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .calc-box { background: white; padding: 24px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); max-width: 400px; margin: 32px auto; }
  .input-group { margin-bottom: 16px; } .input-group label { display: block; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .input-group input { width: 100%; padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #d1d5db; border-radius: 4px; box-sizing: border-box; }
  button { width: 100%; padding: 10px; background: #2563eb; color: white; border: none; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: bold; }
  .result-box { margin-top: 24px; padding: 16px; background: #eff6ff; border: 1px solid #bfdbfe; border-radius: 4px; }
  .hidden { display: none; } .total { font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 8px 0; } .sub { font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; }
  .article-content { margin-top: 40px; line-height: 1.6; } .article-content h2 { margin-top: 32px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; }
</style>
